# Cyrillic letters table, includes А-Я letters and their common translations across most Cyrillic Braille codes
# Note: This table includes only letters that are commonly used in multiple languages. Other letters have not been defined. If any of the following are used in your language, you must define them in your language's table:
# й (commonly used, but multiple different standards for encoding)
# і, ѝ, ў, ѣ, ѫ, ғ, қ, ң, ү, ұ, ҳ, һ, ә, ӡ, ө

lowercase а 1
lowercase б 12
lowercase в 2456
lowercase г 1245
lowercase д 145
lowercase е 15
lowercase ё 16
lowercase ж 245
lowercase з 1356
lowercase и 24
lowercase к 13
lowercase л 123
lowercase м 134
lowercase н 1345
lowercase о 135
lowercase п 1234
lowercase р 1235
lowercase с 234
lowercase т 2345
lowercase у 136
lowercase ф 124
lowercase х 125
lowercase ц 14
lowercase ч 12345
lowercase ш 156
lowercase щ 1346
lowercase ъ 12356
lowercase ы 2346
lowercase ь 23456
lowercase э 246
lowercase ю 1256
lowercase я 1246

base uppercase А а
base uppercase Б б
base uppercase В в
base uppercase Г г
base uppercase Д д
base uppercase Е е
base uppercase Ё ё
base uppercase Ж ж
base uppercase З з
base uppercase И и
base uppercase К к
base uppercase Л л
base uppercase М м
base uppercase Н н
base uppercase О о
base uppercase П п
base uppercase Р р
base uppercase С с
base uppercase Т т
base uppercase У у
base uppercase Ф ф
base uppercase Х х
base uppercase Ц ц
base uppercase Ч ч
base uppercase Ш ш
base uppercase Щ щ
base uppercase Ъ ъ
base uppercase Ы ы
base uppercase Ь ь
base uppercase Э э
base uppercase Ю ю
base uppercase Я я

# Cyrillic case attributes are used in some tables for multi-alphabet support
attribute lowercyrillic абвгдеёжзиклмнопрстуфхцчшщъыьэюя
attribute uppercyrillic АБВГДЕЁЖЗИКЛМНОПРСТУФХЦЧШЩЪЫЬЭЮЯ
